      "section": "Volcano",
      "order": 3,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Every feature placed by its effect size against its significance, with the two\nthreshold lines drawn rather than assumed. The features worth reading are the ones\nfar from the centre and high up; the top-N labels name them for you, and the\nsearch box in the settings menu finds a specific one. Narrowing the category or\nraising the significance floor on the left removes points rather than greying them\nout.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/advanced_viz_demo"
    },
