      "title_size": "sm",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": "About this showcase",
      "order": 4,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "top",
      "body": "Each tab of this project is one advanced visualisation kind, rendered from a small\nsynthetic fixture rather than from a real pipeline run. The point is the kind:\nwhat question it answers, what its settings menu can change, and what a left-panel\nfilter does to it. Nothing here is a result. For the same components on real data,\nlook at the nf-core/ampliseq and nf-core/viralrecon reference projects.\n",
      "wf_tag": "python/advanced_viz_demo"
    }
